# launching-the-gcr

A June 2026 Gulf Coast Radar front end: a home page, restaurants, things to do and a business profile page, built from a large set of page scripts and styles.

Static HTML, CSS and JavaScript prepared for Vercel. Superseded by [`gcr-unified`](https://github.com/CultureReset/gcr-unified); nothing runs from it.

- `index.html`, `restaurants.html`, `things-to-do.html`, `profile.html`: the pages.
- `js/`: page logic and data loading. `css/`: styles. `data/`: local data.

Serve the folder with any static server.
